```spl
* ============================================================================
* C01 - Frozen value / replay
* Read-only. Two signatures: (1) exact freeze, (2) variance collapse.
* Data model: docs/data-model.md
* ============================================================================

* ---- Signature 1: FROZEN VALUE (exact constant beyond max_stall_sec) ----
index=ot_historian sourcetype=historian:snapshot quality=Good
    tag IN ("PLANT1.*.PV")
| sort 0 tag _time
| streamstats current=f last(value) as prev_value by tag
| eval same = if(value==prev_value, 1, 0)
* Mark the start of each constant run and measure how long it has held
| streamstats reset_before="(same==0)" earliest(_time) as stall_start by tag
| eval stall_sec = _time - stall_start
| lookup ot_baseline.csv tag OUTPUT max_stall_sec
| where stall_sec > max_stall_sec
| eval detection="C01", signature="frozen_value", severity="medium"
| table _time tag value stall_sec max_stall_sec signature severity detection

* ---- Signature 2: VARIANCE COLLAPSE (run separately or append) ----
* index=ot_historian sourcetype=historian:snapshot quality=Good tag IN ("PLANT1.*.PV")
* | bin _time span=5m
* | stats var(value) as win_variance avg(value) as win_avg count as n by tag _time
* | lookup ot_baseline.csv tag OUTPUT min_variance
* | where n>=10 AND win_variance < min_variance
* | eval detection="C01", signature="variance_collapse", severity="high"
* | table _time tag win_avg win_variance min_variance signature severity detection
```
